{"id":"instruccio_n","lemma":"instrucción","pos":"noun","rank":1905,"glosses":["instruction","an investigation by a criminal court in order to collect factual evidence directed towards pressing charges against a suspect or reaching a nolle prosequi indictment"],"ipa":"/instɾuɡˈθjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"instrucciones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/71/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-instrucci%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ellos necesitan instrucciones.","en":"They need instructions.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461586","words":[{"g":"they","l":"él"},{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},null]},{"text":"Lo haré siguiendo tus instrucciones.","en":"I'll do it according to your instructions.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/692513","words":[{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"to follow","l":"seguir"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"La experiencia es la mejor instrucción.","en":"Experience is the best teacher.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705891","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"experience"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"better"},null]},{"text":"Lea estas instrucciones.","en":"Read these instructions.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/524617","words":[{"g":"to read","l":"leer"},{"g":"this","l":"este"},null]},{"text":"Lo hice de acuerdo con sus instrucciones.","en":"I did it according to your instructions.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/522050","words":[{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},null,null,null,{"g":"his, her, its, their"},null],"phrases":[[2,5,"according to"]]}]}